      "technique": "T1547.001",
      "what_happened": "At 2027-03-14 09:12:07 CET, Wazuh FIM detected a new file written to the per-user Startup folder on WIN-WS-184: syscheck.path=%APPDATA%\\Roaming\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Start Menu\\Programs\\Startup\\OneDriveSync_091207.lnk with syscheck.event=added. The file extension (.lnk) combined with the Startup folder location triggers automatic execution at every subsequent user logon. The filename masquerades as a legitimate OneDrive synchronisation shortcut (OneDriveSync) to avoid suspicion.",
